      <li>Instant InnerTube API search</li>
      <li>Zero-buffer live mpv audio streaming</li>
      <li>Modern Spotify-inspired UI with smooth rounding</li>
      <li>Endless radio queue &amp; shuffle/repeat support</li>
    </ul>
